    {
      "id": "5xqyR68AznFOC1GKFxwO8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 79.53700114020296,
      "y": -116.65313437980751,
      "width": 700.6595458984375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 521221304,
      "version": 517,
      "versionNonce": 1017773512,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788198094292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. [B2B/B2C] individuals & teams\n2. Manage Tasks, Calendars, Docs.\n3. CRUD Tasks\n4. CRUD Calendar Events\n5. CRUD Docs\n6. Can mention Tasks, Calendar Events, and Docs in each other.\n7. Can connect & sync google calendar\n8. Can create task based on raw text (no transcribe from voice for v0)\n9. Auth: Better Auth, Google only. One web client.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. [B2B/B2C] individuals & teams\n2. Manage Tasks, Calendars, Docs.\n3. CRUD Tasks\n4. CRUD Calendar Events\n5. CRUD Docs\n6. Can mention Tasks, Calendar Events, and Docs in each other.\n7. Can connect & sync google calendar\n8. Can create task based on raw text (no transcribe from voice for v0)\n9. Auth: Better Auth, Google only. One web client.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-zw00fduX_FAI5JIQrlDL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 851.6052970481371,
      "y": -144.91497549227097,
      "width": 673.679443359375,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1548819656,
      "version": 660,
      "versionNonce": 375415480,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788198094292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. [Consistency] Strong for Tasks, Calendar Events, and Docs CRUD\n2. [Consistency] Eventual for Calendar sync\n3. [Traffic] RPC 100 as average, 300 as peak, 300 users/d. Stable.\n4. [Latency] p95 <= 200ms\n5. [Region] Single, EU\n6. [Data] 1m +100K/m\n7. [Costs] Super low cost\n8. [Availability] No specific SLA, 99.9% target.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. [Consistency] Strong for Tasks, Calendar Events, and Docs CRUD\n2. [Consistency] Eventual for Calendar sync\n3. [Traffic] RPC 100 as average, 300 as peak, 300 users/d. Stable.\n4. [Latency] p95 <= 200ms\n5. [Region] Single, EU\n6. [Data] 1m +100K/m\n7. [Costs] Super low cost\n8. [Availability] No specific SLA, 99.9% target.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mSi8cv0mAzoDlCzgFPg6P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1609.2528787537667,
      "y": -153.53213452835877,
      "width": 610.1596069335938,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
