      "versionNonce": 1093211832,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788198094292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Update calendar events at the same time from other source\n   → etag LWW + lastGoogleUpdatedAt; unique(googleEventId)\n2. Google token revoked mid-sync → mark connection broken, stop push\n3. Mention target deleted → drop EntityLink, leave stale chip as text",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Update calendar events at the same time from other source\n   → etag LWW + lastGoogleUpdatedAt; unique(googleEventId)\n2. Google token revoked mid-sync → mark connection broken, stop push\n3. Mention target deleted → drop EntityLink, leave stale chip as text",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
