      "id": "flows-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1164,
      "y": 1030,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 480,
      "text": "Auth\n1. web signIn.social(google) → API /api/auth\n2. callback sets httpOnly cookie on API origin\n3. first login: Workspace + owner Member\n4. GCal: incremental consent on same Google account\n\nCRUD (strong)\nGuard → sole membership → 1 txn → bump workspace.updatedAt\np95 ≤ 200ms is this path only\n\nGCal sync (eventual)\nwebhook + 5–15m poll · syncToken · unique(googleEventId)\nlocal PATCH pushes if linked\nconflict: etag LWW, keep lastGoogleUpdatedAt\n\nfrom-text\nPOST /v1/tasks/from-text → ParseService (heuristics v0)\n\nMentions\neditor node {type,id} → rewrite EntityLink\npeek: GET /v1/resources/:type/:id\ndeep-link /tasks /calendar /docs",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Auth\n1. web signIn.social(google) → API /api/auth\n2. callback sets httpOnly cookie on API origin\n3. first login: Workspace + owner Member\n4. GCal: incremental consent on same Google account\n\nCRUD (strong)\nGuard → sole membership → 1 txn → bump workspace.updatedAt\np95 ≤ 200ms is this path only\n\nGCal sync (eventual)\nwebhook + 5–15m poll · syncToken · unique(googleEventId)\nlocal PATCH pushes if linked\nconflict: etag LWW, keep lastGoogleUpdatedAt\n\nfrom-text\nPOST /v1/tasks/from-text → ParseService (heuristics v0)\n\nMentions\neditor node {type,id} → rewrite EntityLink\npeek: GET /v1/resources/:type/:id\ndeep-link /tasks /calendar /docs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
