      "updated": 1788198072196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "build-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -321,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "1. Services: todex-api Nest modules — Auth, Workspace, Tasks, Calendar, Docs, Links, Parse.\n   Sync worker = pg-boss inside the API process (not a second deploy).\n   todex-web = Next App Router only. DTOs in @repo/api.\n2. Database: Postgres EU + Drizzle. Better Auth tables + domain schemas above.\n3. Communication: HTTPS REST + cookie session. Google Calendar HTTP + push channel.\n   No gRPC, no bus.\n4. Cloud: single EU region. Managed Postgres (Neon/Fly) + 1–2 API instances + Next on Vercel/Fly.\n   Google OAuth + Calendar API.\n\nOrder: Auth+Workspace → Tasks → local Calendar → GCal → Docs → Links.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Services: todex-api Nest modules — Auth, Workspace, Tasks, Calendar, Docs, Links, Parse.\n   Sync worker = pg-boss inside the API process (not a second deploy).\n   todex-web = Next App Router only. DTOs in @repo/api.\n2. Database: Postgres EU + Drizzle. Better Auth tables + domain schemas above.\n3. Communication: HTTPS REST + cookie session. Google Calendar HTTP + push channel.\n   No gRPC, no bus.\n4. Cloud: single EU region. Managed Postgres (Neon/Fly) + 1–2 API instances + Next on Vercel/Fly.\n   Google OAuth + Calendar API.\n\nOrder: Auth+Workspace → Tasks → local Calendar → GCal → Docs → Links.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
